1
00:00:00,311 --> 00:00:02,481
(Leonard:)They're probably
just all staring at the sky.

2
00:00:02,646 --> 00:00:04,896
(Sheldon:)All right, what we need now
is a tactical retreat.

3
00:00:05,066 --> 00:00:08,356
Did you see Stargate
where they found themselves on a planet...

4
00:00:08,527 --> 00:00:11,527
(Sheldon:)...with a culture based loosely
on Earth's Athens and Sparta?

5
00:00:12,364 --> 00:00:14,154
(Sheldon:)Not important.

6
00:00:14,325 --> 00:00:17,165
Leonard, Raj and I are gonna burst out
the door and run away.

7
00:00:17,328 --> 00:00:18,368
(Sheldon:)Howard will cover us.

8
00:00:18,537 --> 00:00:20,997
But why don't I run away
and you cover me?

9
00:00:21,165 --> 00:00:23,625
(Sheldon:)Because you chose your mother's veins
over victory.

10
00:00:24,293 --> 00:00:26,333
(Sheldon:)On three. One, two, three, go!

11
00:00:26,712 --> 00:00:28,962
[ALL SCREAMING
AND PAINTBALLS FIRING]

12
00:00:29,632 --> 00:00:34,182
(Howard:)I had to take her.
It's almost bathing-suit weather.

13
00:00:35,012 --> 00:00:36,142
[PAINTBALLS FIRING]

14
00:00:37,515 --> 00:00:38,725
[HOWARD SHRIEKS]

15
00:00:39,350 --> 00:00:42,310
I surrender, don't shoot.
They went that way.

16
00:00:42,895 --> 00:00:44,895
LESLIE:
Howard, I'm on your team.

17
00:00:45,356 --> 00:00:46,736
(Howard:)Oh, Leslie, thank God.

18
00:00:48,067 --> 00:00:50,487
- Where's the rest of your squad?
- Uh...

19
00:00:51,278 --> 00:00:53,118
(Howard:)They left me here to die.

20
00:00:53,280 --> 00:00:54,610
(Howard:)What about yours?

21
00:00:54,782 --> 00:00:57,282
- Dead. All of them.
- Sorry.

22
00:00:57,451 --> 00:00:58,871
(Leslie:)Don't be.

23
00:00:59,036 --> 00:01:02,026
(Leslie:)It was friendly fire.

